/T (The Ruby Jubilee International Conference aims to critically engage with the multifaceted role of information, knowledge systems, technologies, and libraries in shaping and responding to the complexities of various socio-cultural and academic environments. In an era defined by rapid technological change, growing information needs, and evolving knowledge paradigms, the conference seeks to provide a forum for intellectual exchange, collaboration, and reflection on how these elements intersect and influence one another.)
